OL,3,ASteve Irwin's family celebrates
OL,4,A'superhero' dad, 20 years after shock
OL,5,Adeath
OL,6,
OL,7,FAustralian conservationist Bindi Irwin
OL,8,Fhas marked the 20th anniversary of her
OL,9,Ffamous father's death with a touching
OL,10,Ftribute to the man best known as the
OL,11,F"Crocodile Hunter".
OL,13,FSteve Irwin died on 4 September 2006,
OL,14,Faged 44, after a stingray fatally
OL,15,Fpierced his chest while he was
OL,16,Funderwater filming a documentary at the
OL,17,FGreat Barrier Reef.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
PN,11914
SC,0014
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1788499346
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ASteve Irwin's family celebrates
OL,4,A'superhero' dad, 20 years after shock
OL,5,Adeath
OL,6,
OL,7,FBindi, who was eight when her father
OL,8,Fdied, called Steve a "superhero" in an
OL,9,Fonline post on Friday, saying she has
OL,10,F"watched the world mourn my dad with
OL,11,Four family" for the past two decades.
OL,13,F"I always thought that my dad's legacy
OL,14,Fis wildlife conservation; it turns out,
OL,15,Fhis legacy is love. For our planet and
OL,16,Ffor each other," Bindi, 28, wrote on
OL,17,FInstagram.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
